(pito-compare) from frames.toml beside it. All are © 2026 Cătălin Ilinca, under the
MIT licence like the code (see ../../LICENSE). The names and logos in them stay as
../../TRADEMARKS.md says.
The folders header/, footer/, hourglass/ and list/ hold the pictures of
pito_tui::header, ::footer, ::hourglass and ::list, made from their own examples
(examples/<module>_*.rs) and recorded from ../../render/<module>/; they are ©
2026 Cătălin Ilinca under the MIT licence the same way, and ../../NOTICE.md names
the source of each.
pitomd-wordmark.svg is the PITO MD wordmark, copied by ../../bin/marks from the
PITO MD brand masters; it is not under the MIT licence (see ../../NOTICE.md and
../../TRADEMARKS.md).
../../bin/marks takes it from the tracked export exports/pitomd/readme/wordmark.svg
of the brand masters at aa3aee8b232a1b848995bf3d9a012a01d4aff8ec: © Cătălin
